# Where unreleased builds kept the debug dump and each session's web state, inside the mod's folder:
# a clone that ran one may still hold them, so they are never committed. Eagle Eye keeps both in its home
# (~/.claude/eagle-eye by default, plugin/hooks/web.ts). Unanchored, so a clone's old ones at the top stay out too.
.debug/
.web/

